  <div class="layout"><div class="gtm-embed w-embed"></div><NavbarEn /><div class="section-hero container bottom-padding">
      <h1 class="title-1-4">Find the answers<br>to your questions!<br></h1>
      <div class="w-layout-grid faq-grid page-faq">
        <div class="w-layout-grid faq-topic-grid-3">
          <div id="w-node-fffc0308-a052-2a5c-5f6d-13b00ebc9db5-6643cc3c" data-w-id="fffc0308-a052-2a5c-5f6d-13b00ebc9db5" class="accordion-wrapper-2">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <div style="color:rgb(48,67,81)" class="accordion-title-2">Can we choose only one module of the solution?<br></div>
              <div class="expand-icon-2"><img src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc597bea19f9a7_plus.svg" alt></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text">The Innovorder solution, which offers a complete ecosystem of solutions, has been designed by module. This means that each module can be used independently of the others, although the full value of the solution is realized when it is deployed as a whole.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-w-id="fffc0308-a052-2a5c-5f6d-13b00ebc9dbe" class="accordion-wrapper-2">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <div style="color:rgb(48,67,81)" class="accordion-title-2">What level of customer support does Innovorder offer?<br></div>
              <div class="expand-icon-2"><img src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc597bea19f9a7_plus.svg" alt></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text">Innovorder has an in-house level 1, 2 and 3 support team, which answers by e-mail and telephone and can, if necessary, send technicians on site. We can build a customized support offer according to your needs.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-w-id="fffc0308-a052-2a5c-5f6d-13b00ebc9dc7" class="accordion-wrapper-2">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <div style="color:rgb(48,67,81)" class="accordion-title-2">How many clients does Innovorder work with?<br></div>
              <div class="expand-icon-2"><img src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc597bea19f9a7_plus.svg" alt></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text">Innovorder works with nearly 3,000 clients, including both small and large restaurant chains.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-w-id="fffc0308-a052-2a5c-5f6d-13b00ebc9dd0" class="accordion-wrapper-2">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <div style="color:rgb(48,67,81)" class="accordion-title-2">How is Innovorder structured?<br></div>
              <div class="expand-icon-2"><img src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc597bea19f9a7_plus.svg" alt></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text">Innovorder has a team of nearly 90 people, half of whom are dedicated to R&amp;D to develop the solution.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-w-id="a255a357-7311-eb18-1679-ae55772a76a9" class="accordion-wrapper-2">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <div style="color:rgb(48,67,81)" class="accordion-title-2">Does Innovorder own its solution?<br></div>
              <div class="expand-icon-2"><img src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc597bea19f9a7_plus.svg" alt></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text">Our solution was developed 100% in-house, in France, without ever subcontracting!<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-w-id="bde9c255-6ed4-370f-062e-0db6da349014" class="accordion-wrapper-2">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <div style="color:rgb(48,67,81)" class="accordion-title-2">How long does it take to deploy the Innovorder solution?<br></div>
              <div class="expand-icon-2"><img src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc597bea19f9a7_plus.svg" alt></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text">The Innovorder solution is a unique SaaS solution deployed at all our customers. A deployment takes on average between 2 and 5 weeks depending on the complexity of the project and our deployment schedule.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-layout-grid faq-topic-grid-3">
          <div id="w-node-fffc0308-a052-2a5c-5f6d-13b00ebc9dda-6643cc3c" data-w-id="fffc0308-a052-2a5c-5f6d-13b00ebc9dda" class="accordion-wrapper-2">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <div style="color:rgb(48,67,81)" class="accordion-title-2">Can we trust a start-up?<br></div>
              <div class="expand-icon-2"><img src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc597bea19f9a7_plus.svg" alt></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text">Innovorder is an innovative company that works with the largest restaurant groups and has a solid financial base to develop its business over the long term.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-w-id="fffc0308-a052-2a5c-5f6d-13b00ebc9de3" class="accordion-wrapper-2">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <div style="color:rgb(48,67,81)" class="accordion-title-2">Does the solution work without internet?<br></div>
              <div class="expand-icon-2"><img src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc597bea19f9a7_plus.svg" alt></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text">We have developed a degraded mode that allows a normal use of the solution without internet. For modules requiring internet (e-commerce..), we can install back up solutions (routers, 4G...).<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-w-id="fffc0308-a052-2a5c-5f6d-13b00ebc9dec" class="accordion-wrapper-2">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <div style="color:rgb(48,67,81)" class="accordion-title-2">Do the evolutions of the solution pay off?<br></div>
              <div class="expand-icon-2"><img src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc597bea19f9a7_plus.svg" alt></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text">We update our solution every month and operate in SaaS mode, which means that each update benefits all of our customers, free of charge.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-w-id="fffc0308-a052-2a5c-5f6d-13b00ebc9df5" class="accordion-wrapper-2">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <div style="color:rgb(48,67,81)" class="accordion-title-2">What is Innovorder's business model?<br></div>
              <div class="expand-icon-2"><img src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc597bea19f9a7_plus.svg" alt></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text">Innovorder provides a plug &amp; play solution in SaaS mode: hardware, service (installation, training, etc.), license, maintenance and updates. Pricing is in the form of a quarterly or annual subscription, and we can build customized offers according to your expectations.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-w-id="3e066d0b-9f61-4109-510c-c1df5456feab" class="accordion-wrapper-2">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <div style="color:rgb(48,67,81)" class="accordion-title-2">In which countries is Innovorder deployed?<br></div>
              <div class="expand-icon-2"><img src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc597bea19f9a7_plus.svg" alt></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text">Innovorder has deployed its solutions in France, Belgium, Switzerland and Luxembourg.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-w-id="97c0aced-5c9f-d9ac-d432-04de0c52e9c9" class="accordion-wrapper-2">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <div style="color:rgb(48,67,81)" class="accordion-title-2">Why work with Innovorder?<br></div>
              <div class="expand-icon-2"><img src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc597bea19f9a7_plus.svg" alt></div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text">Innovorder has developed a unique point-of-sale digitalization solution coupled with strong human support. Working with Innovorder is the certainty of seeing your business grow, improving your efficiency and better managing your network, all in a strong partnership relationship.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></div>
